WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:06.730
This story is one that lightly describes the ordinary daily lives of the three Minami sisters.

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:09.340
Please don't expect too much from it.

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:11.300
Also, watch in a bright room,

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.990
and stay 3 meters away from the TV while watching.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:22.370
Kana

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:22.710
Chiaki

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:23.500
Haruka

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Let's go to the Beach

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:58.140
Ah... Hot...

00:01:58.140 --> 00:01:59.600
It's summer.

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:01.170
Summer.

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:03.550
It's summer, isn't it?

00:02:03.550 --> 00:02:05.840
Is it summer?

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:07.980
It should be summer!

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:13.850
Why is there a need to emphasize that it is summer so much?

00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:15.990
Haruka, let's go to the beach.

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:17.390
Sounds nice...

00:02:17.390 --> 00:02:19.620
Chiaki, want to go?

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:21.370
Yes, I want to go.

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:25.540
Okay! Then shall we go next Sunday?

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:28.540
Eh?! We're going because Chiaki says she wants to?

00:02:28.930 --> 00:02:32.870
That's not it! Since both of you say you want to go...

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:36.400
Th-That's right! We have to find our swimsuits!

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:39.930
Oh yeah, that reminds me, I haven't taken mine out for quite a while.

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:43.350
Let's see...

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.690
Here it is!

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:56.780
Chiaki, have you also found your swimsuit?

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:58.610
Yes, but...

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:01.780
It... looks a bit small...

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:14.790
Too tight

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:20.040
It doesn't fit because we've grown taller, right?

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:23.310
Yes! It's definitely not because we've gotten fatter!

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:27.180
That convenient phrase, "we've grown", is our trump card.

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:29.920
Alright! We'll go buy some new swimsuits!

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:31.520
Let's go, Chiaki!

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.840
And Haruka, you make the dinner!

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:35.360
Okay!

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:36.270
Eh?

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:38.490
What about my swimsuit?

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:41.550
Don't worry, we'll choose it for you.

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:50.500
If we had chosen those with separate pieces, it wouldn't have come to this.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:53.170
We haven't gotten fat anyway.

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:54.970
Isn't that right?

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:56.160
Yeah.

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:59.190
Speaking of which, Haruka's swimsuit should not only have a separate top and bottom.

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:01.990
It's better to choose one which separates left and right too.

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:06.630
That means, the cloth is divided into two...

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:09.390
Also, it's tied together by strings.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.370
I-I don't want that!

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:14.600
I can't let Haruka-neesama wear that outfit in front of other people!

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:16.770
You're still a child, Chiaki.

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:17.900
What did you just say?

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:20.110
You don't get it.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:21.300
Listen well,

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:22.990
When a girl becomes a high school student,

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:26.920
Not having that amount of exposure is strange.

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:30.250
Just think about it.

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:33.370
Everybody's exposing their skin, but Haruka will the only one,

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:38.090
Diving into the water with an outfit like an astronaut's suit.

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:40.550
She'll stand out like a sore thumb!

00:04:40.870 --> 00:04:43.040
And then everyone will ask,

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:46.260
"How many leagues under the sea are you descending?"

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:50.010
Are you intending to bring shame to Haruka?

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:56.100
That's why the only thing we can do for her to not bring her shame...

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.820
Is to prepare a skimpy swimsuit for her.

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:05.240
<i>As expected of a junior high school student.</i>

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:08.240
<i>The existence closest to a senior high school student.</i>

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:10.770
Thanks for the meal!

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:13.040
Tonight's meal was delicious too.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:14.670
It's nothing much.

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:20.440
By the way, Kana, it's about time you show me what swimsuit you bought for me.

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:21.840
This?

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:25.300
Just look forward to it on the day itself.

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:40.900
Noooo! I beg of you to stop!

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:42.850
Hey, wait a minute!

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:45.650
Don't be forceful with me... Please don't!

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:48.730
Really, don't make those weird noises.

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:57.960
I tried my best to pick one that would not bring shame to you.

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:07.300
I'm sure you're not so mean as to make your cute little sister's effort go to waste, right?

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:12.260
Minami-ke!

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:23.090
The sound of falling rain is nice...

00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:25.410
That's so true, Haruka-neesama.

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:28.150
I feel like my spirit's refreshed.

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:30.150
Chiaki.

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:33.000
How many days has it been since it started raining?

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:35.800
Three days?

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:37.800
Yes, it's been three days!

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:41.330
Tomorrow is Sunday. This way we can't go to the beach!

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:44.000
So what do you mean, it refreshes the spirit?!

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.700
Don't get so mad.

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:47.870
Thanks to the rain the weather's gotten cooler,

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:50.820
So the original purpose of our beach trip has been fulfilled.

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:54.430
I don't care about what its purpose was at a time like this!

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:56.970
I want to go to the beach!

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:58.790
There, there.

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:03.310
Listening to the sound of falling rain while passing the time is an enjoyable thing too.

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:04.920
I agree.

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:06.410
Come, close your eyes.

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:11.880
And you should also perk up your ears to this beautiful song of nature.

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:17.540
If the weather still doesn't behave itself, even the concrete will become soggy!

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:22.480
Yeah...

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:25.660
Hey, Raincloud!

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:27.830
Haruka-neesama is troubled!

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:29.720
Give us the sun, you dumbass!

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:39.310
Alright. Let's make a charm to ward off the rain.

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:44.760
You just laughed, didn't you?

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:46.300
I didn't.

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:47.790
Yes you did.

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:49.400
Well, I couldn't help it.

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:52.070
Alright, I see. I understand now!

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:55.290
I'm going to roll you up in a sheet and hang you!

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:57.580
Okay, if you think you can do it, go ahead.

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:03.330
For real?

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:04.150
Sensei!

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:05.700
Ninomiya-kun!

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:09.600
Hey, let me down, you dumbass!

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:11.140
Do your best, Chiaki!

00:08:11.140 --> 00:08:13.680
I'm entrusting tomorrow's weather to you!

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:18.080
<i>Eh? Is Haruka-neesama enjoying herself?</i>

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:20.100
I won't let you down until the rain stops!

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:21.560
Do your best!

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:23.770
What in the world do you want me to do?

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:25.270
Negotiation

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:27.510
Raincloud-san, Raincloud-san.

00:08:27.510 --> 00:08:30.690
That's enough, please go away.

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:35.450
The rain looks like it's getting stronger.

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:37.770
What are you doing making the raincloud angry?!

00:08:37.770 --> 00:08:39.030
Do it more politely!

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:40.540
Negotiation II

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:45.450
Raincloud-san, you have graced the earth with sufficient moisture.

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:48.170
I humbly implore you to pull back.

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:52.760
The rain's getting lighter!

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:54.550
Alright! A little bit more!

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.090
Negotiation III

00:08:56.360 --> 00:09:00.560
You must be worn out after toiling for three days and three nights, Raincloud-sama.

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:05.020
Please take a rest for the time being, so that there isn't a water shortage.

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:08.040
It... It stopped...

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:08.900
It... It stopped...

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:11.810
You did it, Chiaki!

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:19.240
After the rain the air feels great.

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:21.090
That's nice.

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:22.690
That's a magnificent feat, Chiaki!

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:24.270
We can now go to the beach!

00:09:24.270 --> 00:09:25.540
R-Really?

00:09:26.050 --> 00:09:29.460
Do your stuff again when it rains next time!

00:09:38.730 --> 00:09:40.140
Come, over here.

00:09:43.070 --> 00:09:45.100
Good morning!

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:47.600
It's great that today is sunny!

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:51.820
Yup! Chiaki really tried hard to make it possible!

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:54.500
I'll be finished with the preparations soon,

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:56.430
So wait in the living room for the time being.

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:58.660
Okay! Thanks for having us!

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:02.530
The rain has cleared!

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:05.180
It's time for us to set off for the beach!

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:07.330
Enough of your nonsense! Let me down!

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:08.250
Chiaki.

00:10:09.240 --> 00:10:10.020
What happened...

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:10.980
Don't ask!
What happened...

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:13.830
Even if you say that...

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:15.670
Don't ever come again, raincloud!

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:18.380
I hate you!

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:23.440
Idiot, what are you doing?!

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:25.700
Raincloud-san, we're sorry.

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:29.390
That was a lie, there is not a single person who hates you!

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:30.730
Everybody loves you!

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:43.320
Do not worship me!

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:50.080
Do not worship me!

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:02.430
We've reached the sea!

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:07.680
We'll swim around so much that even the Pacific Ocean will seem small!

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:16.340
What are you thinking?

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:17.290
What?

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:19.130
Don't "what" me.

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:22.230
We chose a skimpy swimsuit just for you,

00:11:22.230 --> 00:11:25.050
So why are you still clad in all that excess clothing?

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:27.700
Wouldn't that be a bother to the others?

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:32.210
Even though I'm wearing it now for Chiaki...

00:11:32.730 --> 00:11:35.440
I need some mental preparation.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:37.880
Come quickly, okay?

00:11:44.690 --> 00:11:45.680
Take that!

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:51.250
Take that!

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:08.370
Wow, you're good at this!

00:12:08.940 --> 00:12:10.720
You think so?

00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:16.230
Haruka's really taking her time.

00:12:18.310 --> 00:12:19.670
Shall I call for her?

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:28.220
I'll have to resort to force!

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.300
Stop!

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:33.570
Enough!

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:40.470
Trying to strip me by force is useless!

00:12:40.470 --> 00:12:42.490
You're putting on even more clothes!

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:45.970
The enemy's a tough nut to crack.

00:12:45.970 --> 00:12:48.120
Who's the enemy, you idiot.

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:50.120
I don't understand why she's not taking off her clothes,

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:52.410
But let me talk to her this time.

00:12:54.450 --> 00:12:59.930
Haruka-neesama, we've come all the way to the beach, so let's go take a dip together.

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:01.690
Yeah...

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:04.950
Let me think about it a little more.

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:06.410
Sure, please take your time.

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:07.840
That's hopeless!

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:11.230
If you give her time to think, she'll brood over it until the sun sets!

00:13:11.230 --> 00:13:12.690
Is-Is that so...

00:13:12.690 --> 00:13:17.390
Okay! Let's see which of us can make Haruka take off her clothes first!

00:13:17.390 --> 00:13:19.560
Like in <i>"The North Wind and the Sun"</i>, eh?

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:21.070
Sun

00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:27.700
So bright!

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:29.200
North Wind

00:13:33.070 --> 00:13:34.140
That's cooling!

00:13:34.140 --> 00:13:35.420
What are you doing?

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:37.000
That's making her comfortable!

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:39.700
Your plan wasn't that great either.

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:43.110
In that case, let's splash water on her!

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:45.590
And then she'll give in!

00:13:47.280 --> 00:13:49.970
Wait! You'll only make her mad!

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:56.420
<i>What are they up to this time?</i>

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:58.190
Haruka?

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.650
Look, it really is Haruka!

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:04.280
Maki, Atsuko!

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:05.940
Hayami-senpai too!

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:07.010
What a coincidence.

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:08.740
We came along with the rest of the club members.

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:10.640
That's because we all get along nicely!

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:12.240
I see!

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:17.130
We're playing beach volleyball over there, would you like to join us?

00:14:17.130 --> 00:14:20.040
I came with my sisters today...

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:23.710
<i>All of them are pretty daring.</i>

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:27.420
<i>Now I feel like I'm too self-conscious...</i>

00:14:28.020 --> 00:14:30.640
<i>Or should I say it feels strange if I don't take off my clothes?</i>

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:31.850
What?

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:32.780
What's wrong?

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:34.810
Staring at us like that.

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:37.240
With this, no matter how stubborn Haruka is...

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:39.270
Okay, see you later!

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:53.240
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:14:54.170 --> 00:14:56.540
Shall we go play with everyone then?

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:02.130
Yes, Haruka-neesama!

00:15:05.230 --> 00:15:06.010
Incredible.

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:07.560
Incredible, isn't it?

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:11.010
That goes without saying. Haruka-neesama is amazing!

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:14.010
Hey, everyone come along quick!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:15.680
Yes!

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:22.440
Erm...

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:25.650
What did you do to make Haruka strip?

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:28.860
Minami-ke!

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:32.630
I'm stuffed!

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:34.830
Lunch was delicious, wasn't it?

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:39.060
Oh, the tea ran out?

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:42.440
Then I'll go buy some chilled drinks, okay?

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:43.520
I'll help.

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:45.360
I'll come along too!

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:46.820
I'll come with you.

00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:49.010
Can you help me with the drinks then?

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:53.960
Wh-What the heck are you doing?

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:55.450
Wh-What the heck are you doing?

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:56.600
I have something to discuss with you.

00:15:58.460 --> 00:16:04.910
What is so important that you would stop me from going with Haruka-neesama, you dumbass!

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:05.890
That hurts...

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:10.800
The sand stuck to your foot is rubbing my face. It hurts!

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:16.370
Out of the blue, I have the feeling that my value to both of you is diminishing.

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:20.590
Yes! So much so that I can't even make Haruka strip!

00:16:20.590 --> 00:16:22.170
On an unrelated note,

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:27.170
Your value to me is still diminishing.

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:28.950
Is that in present continuous tense?

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:30.500
Yes, present continuous tense.

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:31.630
Stop!

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:33.530
Don't ask for the impossible.

00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:36.430
Now, how much am I worth?

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:39.760
Until just now it was around there.

00:16:40.490 --> 00:16:42.230
Now it's around there.

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:45.020
Beach slipper...

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:51.440
Are you saying that my worth is comparable to that of an abandoned beach slipper?

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:53.900
Time to redeem myself!

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:56.720
Do you hear, Chiaki?

00:16:56.720 --> 00:17:02.290
Right now we have the responsibility to look after Uchida and Yoshino in place of their parents.

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:03.310
Isn't that so?

00:17:03.310 --> 00:17:04.330
That's right.

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:07.060
If they drown or something, we'll be in deep trouble.

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:08.490
Indeed.

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:11.840
That's why I prepared this.

00:17:16.400 --> 00:17:18.930
With this, we can save them!

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:22.020
My worth is skyrocketing!

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:22.040
Your idiocy is what's skyrocketing.
My worth is skyrocketing!

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:24.730
Your idiocy is what's skyrocketing.

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:27.050
So it's only useful if they drown first?

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:29.610
In the first place, this is MY float!

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:32.070
If that's the case...

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:34.940
What the hell is this?

00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:38.770
After your attempt at a Teru-teru-bōzu, you're going to make me into an "Umibōzu" this time?

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:41.060
How effective is it?

00:17:41.060 --> 00:17:44.250
Hey, what does an Umibōzu do anyway?

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:45.530
Listen up, Chiaki.

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:48.030
If Uchida or Yoshino are about to drown,

00:17:48.030 --> 00:17:49.960
Grab hold of them and don't let go, okay?

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:53.420
I'll fish you all up in one go!

00:17:58.020 --> 00:18:00.550
If you really want to fish, go board a fishing boat.

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:01.590
Enough of this.

00:18:01.590 --> 00:18:02.850
You should just get lost.

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:06.000
Wear this abandoned slipper while you're at it!

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:34.880
Oh my! Aren't you Chiaki-chan?

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:36.960
What are you doing by yourself?

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:39.140
Where's Haruka and Kana-chan?

00:18:39.140 --> 00:18:42.530
Haruka-neesama went to buy something.

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:44.510
Kana is...

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:52.470
I might have said a little too much.

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.150
Chiaki, sorry to keep you waiting!

00:18:56.420 --> 00:18:57.610
Oh, where's Kana?

00:18:59.590 --> 00:19:03.680
Geez, that Kana... Leaving Chiaki all by herself...

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:08.110
Haruka-neesama, Kana is...

00:19:08.110 --> 00:19:09.790
Hey!

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:12.040
Hey!

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:14.040
Yahoo!

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:18.760
Look, I found a huge seashell!

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:23.490
You look more like a Kappa than an Umibōzu.

00:19:23.490 --> 00:19:26.020
Why are you at the sea?

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:28.180
Go back to the river as soon as possible!

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:30.570
What about your big talk about redeeming yourself?

00:19:30.570 --> 00:19:32.870
You bird-brained idiot!

00:19:33.460 --> 00:19:34.900
Minami-ke!

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:38.860
This is Kana.

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:42.330
Oh! Yoshino? How are you?

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:47.350
I'm fine! But after I came back from the beach it hurts all over!

00:19:47.350 --> 00:19:50.660
People who get red from sunburns will become bald in the future.

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:54.550
This is Chiaki. Don't worry.

00:19:54.550 --> 00:19:56.220
There's no basis for that.

00:19:56.220 --> 00:20:02.590
Come to think of it, you and your sisters all have different personalities, right?

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:05.180
Ah, about tomorrow's home economics class...

00:20:07.170 --> 00:20:09.900
Why aren't we alike?

00:20:09.900 --> 00:20:12.970
Who cares whether we're alike or not.

00:20:13.740 --> 00:20:17.730
If the three of us were all like you, we'd be in trouble.

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:20.020
Hey, dumbass.

00:20:20.020 --> 00:20:21.840
What, dumbass?

00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:24.530
All hell would break loose with the slightest provocation.

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:28.530
<i>If both of them were like me...</i>

00:20:29.150 --> 00:20:30.100
Cooking...

00:20:30.100 --> 00:20:31.290
I did it.

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:32.390
Laundry...

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:33.290
It's done.

00:20:33.970 --> 00:20:37.790
Ah, so carefree...

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:40.670
I'd definitely become a useless person.

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:47.420
This is the second sister.

00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:50.220
Oh, Uchida? How are you?

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:52.120
I'm fine, I'm fine!

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:55.470
I shed a lot of skin after coming back from the beach!

00:20:55.860 --> 00:20:58.250
If you shed too much skin, you'll become shorter.

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:01.310
This is Chiaki.

00:21:01.310 --> 00:21:04.470
Don't believe her. Our second sister is an idiot.

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:06.580
Your family is really nice!

00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:09.880
You have an interesting sister and a really kind sister!

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:12.910
Every day seems fun!

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:16.080
Ah, that's right! About tomorrow's physical education class...

00:21:21.040 --> 00:21:23.030
Picking up where we left off just now...

00:21:23.030 --> 00:21:26.000
It's more interesting when we have different personalities...

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:29.430
And I really love both of you who are so different from me!

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:35.260
Haruka-neesama, please have some sweets.

00:21:35.260 --> 00:21:36.570
Thanks.

00:21:39.180 --> 00:21:40.670
Delicious.

00:21:41.770 --> 00:21:43.290
What's with you two?

00:21:43.290 --> 00:21:45.010
Count me in!

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:47.310
Here, say "aaaahh"!

00:21:47.310 --> 00:21:48.830
I don't want to.

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:56.000
Kappa.

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:30.870
Next Episode

00:23:30.870 --> 00:23:32.260
Welcome, Mako-chan!
Next Episode

00:23:32.260 --> 00:23:32.510
WELCOME!
Next Episode

00:23:32.510 --> 00:23:33.100
WELCOME!

00:23:33.100 --> 00:23:36.520
I wonder why that idiot is always so hyperactive.

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:38.330
Next time, The Birth of Mako-chan!

00:23:38.330 --> 00:23:38.470
By the way, who's Mako-chan?

00:23:38.470 --> 00:23:40.860
Birth of Mako-chan
By the way, who's Mako-chan?

00:23:40.860 --> 00:23:44.890
You're making such a commotion when you don't know anything? Dumbass.
Birth of Mako-chan

00:23:44.890 --> 00:23:44.970
Birth of Mako-chan
